;; 2 the derived secret or finished key, 3 the label, 4 the 32 zero bytes, 5 / 6 the client / server application secret;
;; .high_bss 0 the SHA-256 workspace. Labels are stored as two little-endian 64-bit words. Like the C's, not reentrant.
;;
